-- Items Blizzard changed on live WoW Forever by hotfix after client 1.60.1.70685 shipped, that our hotfixes did not have yet.
-- Source: the live hotfix cache (push 113511) that wowsims/forever (MIT, https://github.com/wowsims/forever) builds its item data
-- from; the rows below are Blizzard's live records, unchanged. Found by comparing our data against wowsims/forever.
--   The Watchers rings 275968-275984: the four ranks get their own names (Initiate's / Tracker's / Watcher's / Warden's Signet of ...)
--     instead of all reading "Watcher's Signet".
--   Plans: Cracked / Mithril / Arcanite Blacksmith Hammer 285289-285291: need Blacksmithing (164), not Engineering (202).
--   Corrupted Gemstone 277154 needs level 60; Faintly Glowing Staff 273845 is a quest item (bonding 4).
--   Forever consumables 287963-287980 (food, potions, stones, oils, Woolen Bag): live flags.
--   9-60 Battery Pack 274048: live price 4000 (was 10000 in our older sniff); plus small flag/icon fixes on 7586, 15138, 280686,
--   270000, 271668.
-- Own hotfix_data ids 2001000-2001099. When a client build ships these records itself, the client diff lists them under
-- hotfix_items_differ: drop them then. Safe to run again.
